atic it needs to handle transform changed and internal physics process notifications, like it did in 4.1 here: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/61adafae2f9dace1f094b89ab2aceebd114e1c01/scene/2d/tile_map.cpp#L1525\r\n\r\nThis PR restores the property to its working state ~~and also adds it to TileMapLayer.~~\r\n\r\nP.S. I removed `TileMapLayer::_update_notify_local_transform` because it had no effect: `NOTIFICATION_LOCAL_TRANSFORM_CHANGED` was not handled (and I don't see why those two settings would need it).\r\n\r\nTest project: [Godot-Physics-Tests](https://github.com/fabriceci/Godot-Physics-Tests) (one test fails before this PR, it succeeds after).","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 re